INSERT INTO `langinfo` VALUES (2131, 'LangClient', 1, '女刺客', 'Female Assassin', 0, '2024-03-06 17:18:26.000000');
INSERT INTO `langinfo` VALUES (2132, 'LangClient', 1, 'ServerScene.NewWarriorDetails', 'Warriors have strong physical strength, are not easy to die in battle, and can carry heavy weapons and defensive items. Warriors are good at close combat, and long-range attacks appear very weak. Fortunately, fighters can carry various equipment specially prepared for fighters to make up for this shortcoming. Warriors are simple to operate and have destructive capabilities, making them very suitable for novices.', 0, '2024-03-06 17:18:26.000000');
INSERT INTO `langinfo` VALUES (2133, 'LangClient', 0, 'ServerScene.NewWarriorDetails', '战士具有很强的体力，战斗中不易死去，能够携带沉重的武器和防御物品。战士\\n擅长于近距离战斗，远距离攻击就显得非常无力，值得庆幸的是，战士可以携带\\n专门为战士所准备的各种装备，弥补这一缺点。战士操作简单，具有破坏能力，\\n非常适合新手。', 0, '2024-03-06 17:18:26.000000');
INSERT INTO `langinfo` VALUES (2134, 'LangClient', 1, 'ServerScene.NewWizardDetails', 'Although the mages are weak, they can use magnificent and powerful spells. The time for the mage to cast magic spells is relatively long, and there are often some loopholes. It is recommended that the mage attack in a place far away from the enemy. In the early stage of having not yet practiced super magic, it is more difficult for a mage to level up, but as the level rises and practice advanced magic, the mage will grow into a tough opponent.', 0, '2024-03-06 17:18:26.000000');
INSERT INTO `langinfo` VALUES (2135, 'LangClient', 0, 'ServerScene.NewWizardDetails', '法师虽然体力微弱，但是可以使用华丽而强有力的法术。法师施展魔法念咒文的\\n时间比较长，往往会出现一些漏洞。建议法师在离敌人比较远的地方进行攻击。\\n尚未练成超强魔法的初期，法师练级比较困难，但是随着等级上升，修炼高级魔\\n法，法师将成长为强硬的对手。', 0, '2024-03-06 17:18:26.000000');
INSERT INTO `langinfo` VALUES (2136, 'LangClient', 1, 'ServerScene.NewTaoistDetails', 'Taoist priests have a deep knowledge of martial arts, are proficient in astronomy, geography and medical skills, and are good at supporting their companions in the rear. Taoist priests can summon pets, and their resistance to magic is also very strong, but on the contrary, Taoist priests have insufficient attack power and their level rise is relatively slow. In order to make up for these weaknesses, it is recommended that Taoist priests form groups to hunt. The most important thing is to be helpful to others.', 0, '2024-03-06 17:18:26.000000');
INSERT INTO `langinfo` VALUES (2137, 'LangClient', 0, 'ServerScene.NewTaoistDetails', '道士对武功研究颇深，精通天文地理和医术，擅长在后方支援自己的同伴。道士\\n可以召唤宠物，对魔法的抵抗力也很强，但是相反，道士的攻击力不足，等级上\\n升速度比较慢。为了弥补这些弱点，建议道士组成小组进行打猎，最重要的是要\\n有助人为乐的心肠。', 0, '2024-03-06 17:18:26.000000');
INSERT INTO `langinfo` VALUES (2138, 'LangClient', 1, 'ServerScene.NewAssassinDetails', 'The assassin who had no history was a member of a secret organization that carried out assassination missions. The assassin hides himself through invisibility, moves and attacks the opponent, and possesses the super skill to kill the opponent with a single knife. However, the physical strength and defense power are low, and it is best to avoid fighting against most enemies. After reaching a certain level, you can choose one, the assassination path suitable for hunting and the assassination path suitable for one-on-one PK, you can choose according to your own interests. The two most important points of this profession are sensitive countermeasures and correct judgment of the situation, so it is suitable for skilled players who have practiced various other professions.', 0, '2024-03-06 17:18:26.000000');
INSERT INTO `langinfo` VALUES (2139, 'LangClient', 0, 'ServerScene.NewAssassinDetails', '前无史册的刺客是执行暗杀任务的秘密组织成员。刺客通过隐身隐藏自己后移动\\n并攻击对方，且拥有一刀杀死对方的超强绝技。但体力和防御力低，最好避免对\\n抗多数敌人。达到一定等级后，可两选一，适合打猎的刺杀之路和适合一对一PK\\n的暗杀之路，可根据自己的兴趣选择。该职业最重要的两点是灵敏的对策和对状\\n况的正确判断，所以适合练过其他各种职业的熟练玩家。', 0, '2024-03-06 17:18:26.000000');
INSERT INTO `langinfo` VALUES (2140, 'LangClient', 1, 'LogingScene.LodedProcess', 'Attempting to connect to the server.', 0, '2024-03-06 17:18:26.000000');
INSERT INTO `langinfo` VALUES (2141, 'LangClient', 0, 'LogingScene.LodedProcess', '加载客户端信息...\\n请稍等...', 0, '2024-03-06 17:18:26.000000');
